# Ralph Loop

1. Read `PRD.md` and `progress.txt` from disk at the start of task work.
2. Do **one** unchecked PRD task per turn unless the user explicitly asks otherwise.
3. Append results to `progress.txt` (never rewrite history).
4. Mark the task `[x]` in `PRD.md` only after verification (`php -l` / tests as applicable).
5. On phase end, update `.planning/STATE.md` and copy PRD to `docs/archive/`.
6. Git commit/push only when the user asks (this practice repo often does ask).
